# Agent coordination

## Ownership

- **Product / CEO** — priority, scope, sprint goals; no drive-by feature invention
- **Lead Engineer** — integration, merges, critical infra implementation
- **QA + Security** — review before major releases; findings over rewrites
- **Growth / Sales / CX / Cleaner Ops / Revenue** — briefs, copy, ops plans, analysis; hand critical code to Lead Engineer

## Parallel work

- Do not have multiple agents edit the same files at once
- Prefer isolated **git worktrees**, cloud agents, or `best-of-n-runner` for parallel coding
- Integrate through Lead Engineer; resolve conflicts once

## Handoffs

1. Role writes brief → `company/AGENT_REPORTS/` or chat
2. Product confirms priority if scope changes
3. Lead Engineer implements / integrates
4. QA + Security reviews before release

## Built-in Task types only

Use Cursor-supported types (`generalPurpose`, `explore`, `shell`, `best-of-n-runner`, …). Project roles live in `.cursor/agents/` — do not invent custom `subagent_type` enum values.
